# Innovation & Startup Expo – Website Page Prompt

Act as a Senior UI/UX Designer, Frontend Developer, Motion Designer, and Google Apps Script Developer.

Create a premium, modern, responsive webpage in this existing website. This is NOT a separate website—it is a new page integrated into the existing website. Reuse the existing website's Header, Navigation, Footer, typography, spacing, and overall branding so the page feels like a natural extension of the current site.

## Tech Stack
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript (ES6)
- Google Apps Script (Backend)
- Google Spreadsheet (Database)
- Font Awesome Icons
- AOS (Animate On Scroll)
- GSAP (for premium animations)
- Lenis (Smooth Scrolling)
- Vanilla Tilt.js (Card Tilt Effect)

No React, Vue, Angular, Bootstrap, Tailwind, Node.js, PHP, or external backend.

